      "writtenOn": "2020-06-24T03:35:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is because vfs_read \u0026 vfs_write removed, and it replaced by kernel_read / kernel_write at driver side : \n\nbelow is code change:\n\n-               nread \u003d vfs_read(fp, (char __user *)fw_data, fw_size, \u0026fp-\u003ef_pos);\n+               nread \u003d kernel_read(fp, (char __user *)fw_data, fw_size, \u0026fp-\u003ef_pos);\n\n\n-                       ret \u003d vfs_write(filp, write_req-\u003ebuf, write_req-\u003eactual,\n+                       ret \u003d kernel_write(filp, write_req-\u003ebuf, write_req-\u003eactual,",
      "parentUuid": "278316f9_8e2690ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 623,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 623,
        "endChar": 13
